sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Order
  participant S as Stock
  participant P as Pay
  C->>G: Place Order
  G->>O: createOrder()
  O->>S: reserve stock
  alt in stock
    S-->>O: reserved
    O->>P: charge
    P-->>O: paid
    O-->>G: 201 Created
  else out of stock
    S-->>O: rejected
    O-->>G: 409 Conflict
  end
  G-->>C: response
